_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn `servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp:3705-3711`, `decal_owner.get_or_null()` is called but the result is used without a null check:\n\n```cpp\nDecal *decal = decal_owner.get_or_null(decal_instance->decal);\n// ...\nif (decal->distance_fade) {  // CRASH if decal is null\n    float fade_begin = decal->distance_fade_begin;\n```\n\n`decal_instance` IS null-checked (line 3702), but `decal` is NOT. If the decal RID stored in the instance is stale or has been freed, this crashes.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nFree a decal while its instance is still being processed by the renderer.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — null pointer dereference pattern visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reacti